OL,3,GNEWSAQueen Camilla attends race meeting
OL,4,Ain York
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Queen braved some of the first
OL,7,Fheavy rain in weeks to attend the Ebor
OL,8,FFestival at York Racecourse earlier.
OL,10,FQueen Camilla was announced as "the
OL,11,Fmost welcome visitor here at York
OL,12,Ftoday" as she arrived at the venue
OL,13,Fduring a downpour.
OL,15,FThe royal, who became patron of the
OL,16,Fcourse in 2024, wore a blue straw
OL,17,Ffeathered Philip Treacy hat, an Anna
OL,18,FValentine blue dress and a Jockey Club
OL,19,Fbrooch.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
