OL,3,GNEWSAQueen Camilla attends race meeting
OL,4,Ain York
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhile there, she met retiring jockey
OL,7,FJoe Fanning, who made a full recovery
OL,8,Ffrom prostate cancer at the end of last
OL,9,Fyear, and spoke about how difficult it
OL,10,Fhad been keeping the King's cancer
OL,11,Fdiagnosis a secret.
